  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for implementing European standards relating to anti-discrimination and rights of national minorities in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;Supporting Ukraine in the earlier phases of EU accession negotiations, notably by following up on the 2022 Opinion on Ukraine&apos;s application for membership of the European Union by aligning legislative framework and policy with European standards relating to protection of minorities and non-discrimination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
